<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7040 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.7040 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.7040 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.5750 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     July 1		  June 30</p>
<p> High			     75.7050		 75.4701</p>
<p> Low				75.6000		 75.5800</p>
<p> Open			     75.6000		 75.5000</p>
<p> Close			    75.7040		 75.5750</p>
<p> Volume ($ million)		  2.160		   0.970</p>
<p>--Almaty Newsroom, + 7 3272 509410</p>
